        "TileImage": "$($repository 335ce4e7-36bb-45cd-aa24-18564d48ed4e).Image",
        "Description": "47. \r\rYou are assigned the following High Value Targets (HVTs) at the Sanguine Fashion Show in Paris, France. Below are the listed targets and the preferred kill methods. \r\rSheikh Salman Al-Ghazali: Eliminate with a pistol headshot.\rLana Caprice: Eliminate with injected lethal poison.\rLindsey La Coeur: Eliminate by drowning.\rJay Smart: Eliminate with Fibre wire.\rHelmut Kreuger: Eliminate in a fall. \r\rDiscression is of utmost importance when eliminating these HVTs.\r\rDiana Burnwood",
